    <string name="onboarding_page1_body">Use a crisp double-chop or shake gesture to toggle your flashlight anytime—even in your pocket or when the screen is off.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page2_title">Permissions That Stay Private</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page2_body">ShakeLight requests Camera (torch LED), Notifications (persistent control), and Phone State (auto-pause during calls). No photos or call audio are ever accessed.</string>
